rogress  obviously i want to do more and more  output output and if i had the  opportunity to travel to the country  where the language is spoken then i  could spend a lot more time with output  so output is important  swain's hypothesis  kind of splits hairs in a way  but still  input over output input before output  input more than output that's my take on  it look forward to hearing from you bye  for now  you
 

